# Stage4_ConeSetInline for an object with no cone (ruling 5, 2), at its first call: $1E(a6) = 0,
# so it skips its 6 argument bytes ($0474F4). A real state: the gas orb's escape path ($042208,
# taken by Op2_BranchOffScrX at $0421C6 when the orb leaves the screen sideways) runs the
# SetInline at $042214 (mode 3, close) whether or not the orb has a cone, and an orb gets one only
# from coroutine 1 after its first hit ($04224E), and not even then when the three slots are full
# (047336.syn). The corpus's orbs never left the screen.

case no_cone
w a6 + $1E = 0
